=== IEEE 1800-2023 exists() Method Test ===
Testing exists() on associative arrays only (§7.9.3)
Test 1: Associative array with int key
PASS: assoc_int.exists(0) = 1
PASS: assoc_int.exists(5) = 1
PASS: assoc_int.exists(10) = 1
PASS: assoc_int.exists(1) = 0
PASS: assoc_int.exists(-1) = 0
Test 2: Associative array with string key
PASS: assoc_str.exists("hello") = 1
PASS: assoc_str.exists("foo") = 1
PASS: assoc_str.exists("baz") = 0
PASS: assoc_str.exists("") = 0
Test 3: Delete and check exists
PASS: assoc_int.exists(5) = 0 after delete
PASS: assoc_int.exists(0) = 1 (unchanged)
Test 4: Empty associative array
PASS: empty assoc_wild.exists(0) = 0
PASS: assoc_wild.exists(42) = 1 after assignment
=== Test Summary ===
All exists() tests PASSED
PASS
